  "display_fullname": "Warshade Offensive Umbral Blast Gravitic Emanation",
  "display_help": "Gravitic Emanation sends bolts of dark Nictus energy to multiple targets within a cone area in front of the caster.  Gravitic Emanation deals only minor Negative Energy damage to each affected foe, but pulls then towards you while also leaving them Disoriented and with reduced attack rate and movement speed. This power can be used while in Dark Nova form at an increased range, higher damage and fast recharge. Damage: Minor. Recharge: Slow",
